{"id":"d4d05fd5fa8e94bc","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-pairing-bijective.md","title":"Pairing Function Bijective","display":"thm-pairing-bijective — Pairing Function Bijective","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-pairing-bijective","aliases":["92-thm-pairing-bijective"],"display":"thm-pairing-bijective — Pairing Function Bijective","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-pairing]]"],"source":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义","source_status":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-pairing-bijective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-pairing-bijective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pairing-bijective — Pairing Function Bijective"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J: \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(J: \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (pairing function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,L:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(K,L:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (inverse projections, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pairing\\text{-}bijective} \\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(K(J(x,y))=x\\land L(J(x,y))=y\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\;J(K(z),L(z))=z\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[J:\\mathbb N^2\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbb N\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pairing\\text{-}bijective} \\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(K(J(x,y))=x\\land L(J(x,y))=y\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\;J(K(z),L(z))=z\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[J:\\mathbb N^2\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbb N\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>配对函数是双射</li>\n<li>性质1：投影恢复原元素</li>\n<li>性质2：编码解码恒等</li>\n<li>性质3：一一对应</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J, K, L\">\\(J, K, L\\)</span>都是原始递归</li>\n<li>这保证编码不丢失信息</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J: \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}$ (pairing function, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K,L:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ (inverse projections, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J: \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"K,L:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pairing\\text{-}bijective} \\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(K(J(x,y))=x\\land L(J(x,y))=y\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\;J(K(z),L(z))=z\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[J:\\mathbb N^2\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbb N\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"J, K, L","display":false}],"bytes":1197,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-pairing-bijective]]"}],"outgoing":["20fe67463d98fb92"]}